      "comment": "ROSETTA STREET (1) had to overcome a collision with another runner and could manage only a distant fifth (17.42) in a Free For All over 300m at this track. Little luck latest and can bounce back to best. ASH ROSE (5) is an accomplished sprinter with a great record at the short dashes. Was in the money last time (22.85) over 400m at this track in a Grade 4/5. Is yet to taste defeat in two tries at this distance. Expected to feature. ROXY KEEPING (6) jumped from the inside and boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten 0.8 lengths (17.21) behind Quest For Steps at this track. Expected to feature again. TIME HAS COME (4) should be in the finish fresh from a nine weeks break.",
